{"componentChunkName":"component---src-components-concept-jsx","path":"/metamorfismo-grado/grado-metamorfico-muy-bajo.html","result":{"pageContext":{"node":{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-grado/grado-metamorfico-muy-bajo","type":"Concept","prefLabel":{"es":"grado metamórfico muy bajo","en":"very low metamorphic grade"},"altLabel":null,"hiddenLabel":null,"definition":{"es":"Rocas muy débilmente metamorfizadas, estructuras del protolito ubicuas, asociación mineral de facies de las zeolitas, facies de sub-esquistos verdes, o parte de baja temperatura de la facies de los esquistos azules. Asociaciones minerales según Fry (1984) Tabla 10-1: Material ultramáfico: serpentina (cuarzo, magnesita); material ígneo básico, porción máfica: arcilla, clorita, minerales ígneos relictos; porción calco-alumínica: zeolita básica, pumpellita, epidota, albita; material pelita y semi-pelita: arcillas, clorita, sericita, cuarzo.","en":"Rock very slightly metamorphosed, protolith structure ubiquitous, mineral assemblage of zeolite facies, subgreenschist facies, or low temperature part of blueschist facies. Mineral assemblages according to Fry (1984) Table 10-1: ultramafic-serpentine (quartz, magnesite), mafic-clay, chlorite, relict igneous minerals, calc-aluminous basic-zeolite, pumpellite, epidote, albite, pelite, semi-pelite -- clays, chlorite, sericite, quartz."},"note":null,"changeNote":null,"editorialNote":null,"historyNote":null,"scopeNote":null,"notation":null,"example":null,"narrower":[],"narrowerTransitive":[],"broader":null,"broaderTransitive":null,"related":[],"relatedMatch":null,"broadMatch":null,"narrowMatch":null,"closeMatch":null,"exactMatch":null,"inScheme":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-grado","title":null}],"inSchemeAll":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-grado"}],"topConceptOf":[],"deprecated":null,"isReplacedBy":null},"collections":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/meta